{"sha": "14fe56699097157edac921200dbf588889d71fff10bd41c1034e36ea27f78ea0", "body": ["\\chapter{图形与直角}\\label{ch:g3:shapes}", "", "正方形、长方形、三角形、圆：这些图形都是老朋友。", "本章用几何学家的眼光来看它们 --- 究竟", "是什么让正方形成为正方形？ --- 并引入判断的工具：", "三角尺及其直角。", "", "\\section{直角}", "", "\\begin{definition}[直角]\\label{def:g3:shapes:rightangle}", "\\emph{直角}\\index{直角}是纸张或三角尺", "上的角。两条构成直角的直线", "互相\\emph{垂直}。图中，直角用", "角上的一个小正方形标出。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{method}[检验直角]\\label{met:g3:shapes:check}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 将三角尺的直角顶点", "        精确放在待检验的角顶点上；", "  \\item 把三角尺的一条边沿着角的一边滑动；", "  \\item 若角的另一边恰好沿三角尺的另一边", "        重合 --- 则该角为直角；若张开更大或更小，", "        则它不是直角。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.85]", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) -- (3,0);", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) -- (0,2.2);", "  \\draw[thin] (0.32,0) -- (0.32,0.32) -- (0,0.32);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (1.5,-0.2) {一个直角};", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=5.6cm]", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) -- (3,0);", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) -- (55:2.4);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (1.5,-0.2) {不是直角（太窄）};", "  \\end{scope}", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=11.2cm]", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) -- (3,0);", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) -- (120:2.2);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (1.5,-0.2) {不是直角（太宽）};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 只有第一个角是直角 --- 而且只有小正方形标记，", "或三角尺，才能确认它：仅凭肉眼", "很容易看走眼。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{图形及其性质}", "", "\\begin{definition}[正方形、长方形、三角形]\\label{def:g3:shapes:shapes}", "\\begin{itemize}", "  \\item \\emph{长方形}\\index{长方形}有 $4$ 条边，且有 $4$", "        个直角；它的对边长度相等。", "  \\item \\emph{正方形}\\index{正方形}是 $4$ 条边", "        长度都相等的长方形。", "  \\item \\emph{三角形}\\index{三角形}有 $3$ 条边；", "        \\emph{直角三角形}只有一个直角。", "  \\item \\emph{圆}\\index{圆}是用圆规画出的：", "        圆上所有点到一个定点的距离都相同，这一距离称为", "        \\emph{半径}\\index{半径}，该定点即\\emph{圆心}。", "\\end{itemize}", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.72]", "  % square, right-angle marks drawn inward at each corner", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) rectangle (2,2);", "  \\foreach \\x/\\y/\\dx/\\dy in {0/0/1/1, 2/0/-1/1, 0/2/1/-1, 2/2/-1/-1}", "    \\draw[thin] (\\x+0.22*\\dx,\\y) -- (\\x+0.22*\\dx,\\y+0.22*\\dy)", "      -- (\\x,\\y+0.22*\\dy);", "  \\draw (0.93,-0.07) -- (1.07,0.07);", "  \\draw (0.93,1.93) -- (1.07,2.07);", "  \\draw (-0.07,0.93) -- (0.07,1.07);", "  \\draw (1.93,0.93) -- (2.07,1.07);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (1,-0.35) {正方形};", "  % rectangle", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=3.8cm]", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) rectangle (3,2);", "  \\foreach \\x/\\y/\\dx/\\dy in {0/0/1/1, 3/0/-1/1, 0/2/1/-1, 3/2/-1/-1}", "    \\draw[thin] (\\x+0.22*\\dx,\\y) -- (\\x+0.22*\\dx,\\y+0.22*\\dy)", "      -- (\\x,\\y+0.22*\\dy);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (1.5,-0.35) {长方形};", "  \\end{scope}", "  % right triangle", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=8.6cm]", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) -- (2.6,0) -- (0,2) -- cycle;", "  \\draw[thin] (0.28,0) -- (0.28,0.28) -- (0,0.28);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (1.3,-0.35) {直角三角形};", "  \\end{scope}", "  % circle", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=13.2cm]", "  \\draw[thick] (1,1) circle (1.1);", "  \\fill (1,1) circle (1.5pt);", "  \\draw[omDef, thick] (1,1) -- ++(45:1.1);", "  \\node[omDef, font=\\small, above right] at (1.72,1.68) {半径};", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (1,-0.35) {圆};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 图形一览，附带标记：小正方形表示直角，", "小短线表示相等的边。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[标记为何重要]\\label{ex:g3:shapes:marks}", "画得稍微倾斜的图形，可能\\emph{看上去}像正方形，", "其实并不是。标记说明真相：$4$ 个直角标记 $+$ $4$ 个", "短线标记 $=$ 真正的正方形。画图时要把标记画上；读图时，", "只相信标记和给定的数据。", "\\end{example}", ""]}